      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Hallowed Fountain tapped on turn 1 when Meticulous Archive could have been played instead. Both enter tapped, but Meticulous Archive provides a surveil 1 trigger when it enters, giving card selection advantage. The player has no 1-mana plays available (Seam Rip costs W but there's no target yet since the opponent has no nonland permanents with MV 2 or less), so entering tapped is fine either way, but Meticulous Archive provides strictly more value by letting them surveil. Hallowed Fountain could be played untapped later when the 2 life payment is worth having mana available immediately.",
