      "description": "Playing Steam Vents as the land for the turn means it either enters tapped (losing tempo) or costs 2 life. Since the player has two Islands already and wants to cast blue spells (Opt, Sleight of Hand, Winternight Stories), they don't urgently need red mana yet. More importantly, they should consider casting Sleight of Hand or Opt first before deciding which land to play - cantrips might reveal a better land or change priorities. Playing the land before cantripping is a minor sequencing error. However, since the cantrips cost U and they already have 2 Islands, they could cast a cantrip first and then decide on the land drop based on what they see.",
