      "description": "Kimi25 has Sunbillow Verge in hand and hasn't played a land this turn. They should play the land first before casting Consult the Star Charts, since Consult looks at the top X cards where X is the number of lands they control. Playing the land first would mean looking at 6 cards instead of 5, giving better card selection. Additionally, having more mana available after resolving the spell could be relevant for holding up interaction.",
