    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Chose Tishana's Tidebinder over Restless Anchorage from Consult the Star Charts. The hand is already loaded with reactive spells (No More Lies, Get Lost, Seam Rip, Day of Judgment) and has Hallowed Fountain as a land drop. A UW control deck desperately needs win conditions, and Restless Anchorage is a premium creature-land that serves as an uncounterable threat while also providing mana.",
