    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Kimi25 has 5 untapped lands (Plains, Sunbillow Verge, Sunbillow Verge, Fish Token doesn't tap for mana, Meticulous Archive) and the opponent is tapped out with all 5 lands tapped. This is the perfect window to deploy Rest in Peace, which exiles the opponent's graveyard (containing Into the Flood Maw, Glacial Dragonhunt, Spider-Sense) and shuts off graveyard synergies like Harmonize on Glacial Dragonhunt and cost reduction for Eddymurk Crab. With the opponent tapped out, there's zero risk of counterplay. Seam Rip could also be deployed for free targeting nothing relevant, but Rest in Peace is the high-value play here. Additionally, playing Hallowed Fountain from hand (even tapped) would ensure the land drop isn't missed.",
