      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Opponent is completely tapped out with no board presence, and has 3 instants/sorceries in graveyard enabling Glacial Dragonhunt harmonize and potential Eddymurk Crab cost reduction. Rest in Peace would resolve for free and shut down these synergies. This is the ideal window to deploy it uncountered.",
