    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Rest in Peace would exile the opponent's graveyard (Into the Flood Maw, Glacial Dragonhunt, Spider-Sense) and prevent future graveyard accumulation. The opponent appears to be playing a blue-red spells deck that likely runs Eddymurk Crab or similar cards that benefit from instants/sorceries in the graveyard. Additionally, Glacial Dragonhunt has Harmonize (castable from graveyard), so exiling it now prevents future value. With 3 untapped lands (Plains-producing Sunbillow Verge x2 + Meticulous Archive), Kimi25 could cast Rest in Peace for {1}{W} and still hold up mana for future plays. The opponent is tapped out, so there's no risk of countermagic.",
