      "better_line": "Cast Get Lost targeting Sunderflock (the 5/5 flyer that's harder to deal with) to reduce the clock, then use Day of Judgment next turn if the opponent deploys more threats, or save Day of Judgment and use the second Get Lost for the Eddymurk Crab.",
