      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Kimi25 has two Get Lost in hand and is about to take 5 damage from an unblocked Eddymurk Crab (going from 18 to 13 life), with a Sunderflock also on board threatening 5 flying damage next turn. They have untapped mana available (Plains, Sunbillow Verge, Hallowed Fountain = at least WW available) to cast Get Lost on the Eddymurk Crab before damage. Additionally, they have Day of Judgment in hand which could clean up both creatures next turn, but letting both creatures survive means taking potentially 10 damage next turn (5 ground + 5 flying), putting them to 3 life - extremely dangerous. Removing the Crab now prevents 5 damage and buys time to Day of Judgment the Sunderflock next turn.",
