      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Kimi25 has Rest in Peace in hand and the mana to cast it. The opponent has 5 cards in their graveyard including Eddymurk Crab and Sunderflock, which are key threats that cost less with graveyard-fueled mechanics (Eddymurk Crab costs {1} less for each instant/sorcery in graveyard). Rest in Peace would exile all graveyards and prevent future graveyard accumulation, making the opponent's Eddymurk Crabs and Sunderflock much more expensive to cast. Additionally, Kimi25 has 8 lands and only used some for earlier plays, so there's mana available. While Kimi25's own graveyard has 6 cards, none of them appear to matter for future gameplay. Casting Rest in Peace here is pure upside - it's an enchantment that taxes the opponent's future threats significantly.",
