      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Rest in Peace costs {1}{W} (mana value 2), making it a legal target for Spell Snare. Allowing it to resolve exiles the entire graveyard, which is devastating for Sonnet Vorthos's strategy - they have 6 cards in graveyard including Eddymurk Crab and Sunderflock, and Rest in Peace's static ability means all future cards that would go to the graveyard are exiled instead. This shuts off graveyard synergies (like cost reduction for Eddymurk Crab) and is a permanent enchantment that's difficult to remove in blue. Sonnet Vorthos has TWO copies of Spell Snare in hand, which perfectly counters this 2-mana spell, and has plenty of mana available.",
