    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With 6 untapped lands remaining after the first kicked Burst Lightning, Sonnet Vorthos could have cast a second kicked Burst Lightning to deal 4 additional damage, bringing the opponent from 9 to 5 life. With 3 Spell Snares and a Spell Pierce in hand for interaction, there's little reason to hold the burn spell. Getting the opponent to 5 instead of 9 significantly closes the damage gap.",
